OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a
OL,6,Fdry evening and night across the
OL,7,Fregion with clear spells developing at
OL,8,Ftimes. However, fog and frost are also
OL,9,Flikely to form, the fog becoming quite
OL,10,Fwidespread and locally dense by the
OL,11,Fmorning.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FFog and frost will lift on
OL,14,FTuesday, with a few brighter breaks
OL,15,Fpossible for a time. However, cloud
OL,16,Fwill thicken from the southwest later
OL,17,Fwith wet and breezy conditions
OL,18,Fdeveloping.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
