OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FWednesday will be a rather cloudy day
OL,7,Fwith some patchy rain likely. Much
OL,8,Fsunnier weather will develop
OL,9,Fthereafter, though turning colder from
OL,10,Fthe north, with a widespread overnight
OL,11,Ffrost.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
